<title>HONG KONG: Li &amp; Fung 1996 net rises 33.2 percent.</title>
<headline>Li &amp; Fung 1996 net rises 33.2 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   50.3	vs 40.6</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    26.0	vs 19.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  7.28 loss vs 8.54 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    300.10    vs 225.38</p>
<p>    Turnover		     12,513.86 vs 9,213.10</p>
<p>    Company name		 Li &amp; Fung Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  May 27 to June 3</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   June 3</p>
<p>NOTE - Li &amp; Fung is an export company.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss on expenses incurred in connection with the celebration of the group's 90th anniversary and fireworks display.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 36 cents (including interim dividend 10 cents) vs 28 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
